# Research (docs/story-npcs.md 4), part 3: from npc_gate_searis2's state (same --out), talk to Jack
# (object 0x5A at 260,188) with 0xC set; expect his "I just saw Lucia in Fountain Square" line and flag 0xD.
load jack_room
wait 10
poke u32 0x020B6CB4 0x104000
poke u32 0x020B6CB8 0xCC000
wait 10
press Up 4
wait 10
press A 4
wait 150
shot gate_jack1
press A 4
wait 90
shot gate_jack2
press A 4
wait 90
press A 4
wait 60
dump 0x02204620 0x10 flags_after_jack
